        GOLLANAPALLI DIVYA TEJA, as payment against Flat No: E-504, 5th Floor,
        Block-E in "ANANDA THE DRIZZLE" project situated at Narsingi Village,
        and Neknampur Village, both are in Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy
        District, Telangana State.
    </p>

    <p class="body-text">Below are the payment details: -</p>

    <table class="details">
        <tr>
            <th>Date</th>
            <th>Bank Name</th>
            <th>Mode</th>
            <th>Reference ID / Cheque</th>
            <th>Amount</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>10-04-2025</td><td>HDFC</td><td>Online</td>
            <td>510023365876</td><td>100</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>11-04-2025</td><td>SBI</td><td>Online</td>
            <td>510112375190</td><td>5,00,000</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>21-06-2025</td><td>AXIS</td><td>Online</td>
            <td>000173610027</td><td>9,00,000</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>22-06-2025</td><td>IDBI</td><td>Online</td>
            <td>000100492233</td><td>8,12,412</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>30-06-2025</td><td>HDFC</td><td>TDS Challan</td>
            <td>Challan No: 05850</td><td>22,348</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="total-label" colspan="4">Total Amount in Rs.</td>
            <td class="total-value">22,34,760/-</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="signoff">For M/S. THE DRIZZLE JV</div>

    <div class="signatory">AUTHORISED SIGNATORY</div>

</body>
</html>
</apex:page>